# Per-Dockerfile override of the root .dockerignore, for `docker build -f
# Dockerfile.api` (BuildKit-only feature — the legacy builder ignores this
# file and silently falls back to the root .dockerignore, which excludes
# eda_rl/campaigns/: the exact data this image serves. Build with
# DOCKER_BUILDKIT=1 or `docker buildx build`.)
#
# Same as the root .dockerignore EXCEPT eda_rl/campaigns/ is kept (that's the
# committed data the dashboard API serves), and the frontend's own build
# artifacts are excluded (rebuilt in-stage by Dockerfile.api, never copied
# from the host).

.git
.github

__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.venv/
venv/

eda_rl_runs/
runs/
*.joblib
eda_rl/reports/
reports/
*.optuna-journal
best_configs/

legacy/

.pytest_cache/
htmlcov/
coverage.xml
.coverage

node_modules/
frontend/dist/
